WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:06,380
Hehe, my sister’s hands also smell good.

2
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:12,860
Jian Wuyan has never liked communicating with others since he was a child.

3
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:14,620
